[10:57] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
AUDIO: 'motion. We have this Laura for a K-pop dance. We have this Laura for transforming into a creature, I guess, or we have this retro 90s anime style Laura. In fact, let me download this and show you how to load it into LTX 2.5. So'

[11:10] [scene:talk]
VISUAL: 
